WEBVTT

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.500
(STRAINING)

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.220
Jack-Jack!

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:19.980
The mesmerized supers
know we're here...

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.540
but I found Mom and Dad...
Where's Jack-Jack?

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.940
You lost him?
I gave you one thing to do!

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.740
The tracker. Use the tracker.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.020
(BEEPING)

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:32.940
He's going up?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.180
-He's in an elevator.
-Let's go!

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.700
Hey, little baby.
Where are your parents?

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.820
(GROWLING)

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.380
And here they are, folks!

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.260
The supers who started
this whole thing.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.260
EVELYN: I told you
they'd be there in time.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.820
Hey, did you make them
new masks?

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.820
Yeah. Night vision,
et cetera...

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:54.900
They look good, right?

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.940
WOMAN: (ON TV) So simple,
even he can do it.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:00.940
And we're back live in
three, two, one...

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.580
This is a momentous occasion.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.660
We've all managed
to accomplish

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:07.780
something extraordinarily rare
in today's world.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.660
We agree on something.

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:11.060
(ALL LAUGHING)

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:15.860
We agree to undo
a bad decision.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.020
To make sure

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:19.020
a few extraordinarily
gifted members...

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.860
of the world's many countries
are treated fairly.

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:25.180
To invite them once again
to use their gifts...

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:26.660
to benefit the world.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.140
I thank all of you

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:31.260
for representing your nation's
commitment to superheroes.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.540
With special thanks to
Ambassador Selick.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:35.420
Yeah, it's okay.
Let her hear you.

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:36.860
Thank you.
Thank you so much.

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:38.380
WINSTON: Thank you,
Ambassador,

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:40.540
for your early
and very crucial support.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.100
I can't think of anyone
more deserving than you...

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:44.900
to be the first signature

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:47.940
on the International
Superhero Accord.

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:51.140
-There it is!
-(ALL CHEERING)

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:54.660
(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.420
(MUZAK PLAYING)

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.220
(JACK-JACK WHINING)

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:06.620
(GASPS) Holy cow!

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.140
I know he's on fire.
Just put him out.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.340
(GIGGLING)

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.580
(GASPS) They're coming.

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:28.460
Is it okay to give him that?

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.980
I wasn't hearing
any better ideas.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:32.980
(GIGGLING)

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:47.580
(WHINING)

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:56.700
No!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.020
-(CRYING)
-Come on, Jack-Jack.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:00.100
We have to go.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.420
Cookie num-num?

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:03.660
(GRUNTS)

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.300
(JACK-JACK BABBLING)

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:16.660
-Mama, Mama.
-I see him. He's getting away!

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:18.020
Stand back.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.180
-Darn it!
-He's heading for Mom.

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:30.060
It is done.
The world is super again.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.540
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.860
Group photo. Come on.
Group photo, everyone.

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.260
Squeeze in. That's it.
Historic occasion.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.380
Everyone, smile.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:50.900
Go on phase two.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.340
Years of mandated
hiding and silence

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.980
have made us bitter.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.780
You bring us out
into the light...

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:58.300
only to clean up the messes

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.340
your lack
of discipline creates.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.980
Your bodies
and your character are weak.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:06.580
Your promises are empty,
and you will pay for it.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.220
We no longer serve you.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:12.020
We serve only us.
May the fittest survive.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.820
Well, we, um...

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.300
Some very alarming
moments there...

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.980
before the, uh,
technical difficulties.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:22.500
Please bear with us.

